window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Baba Yaga has taken over and no one knows if Bethany Anne will ever come back.</p><p></p><p>Beaten on the crucible, Bethany Anne decided she will bring justice to the Kurtherian's that tortured the Leath and her people, personally.</p><p></p><p>The problem? She releases Baba Yaga who has now taken control.</p><p></p><p>Even ADAM and TOM aren't sure they can help their friend.</p><p></p><p>While Baba Yaga is tracking down the Seven Kurtherians, her friends and family are desperately trying to find her. During this time, General Lance Reyolds must start negotiations with other star nations who wish to create an Etheric Federation.</p><p></p><p>The problem?</p><p></p><p>How can you complete an Etheric Federation Treaty, if you can't find the Empress?</p><p></p><p>Adapted from the novel and produced with a full cast of actors, immersive sound effects and cinematic music!</p><p></p><p>Performed by Colleen Delany, Emily Beresford, Terence Aselford, Michael John Casey, Amanda Forstrom, Tyler Hyrchuk, Danny Gavigan, Jonathan Lee Taylor, Anthony Palmini, Shanta Parasuraman, Bianca Bryan, Rob McFadyen, Sandi Stock, Eva Wilhelm, Christopher Graybill, Sam Intrater, Shawn K. Jain, Kelly Baskin, David Cui Cui, Rayner Gabriel, Su Ling Chan, James Lewis, John Kielty, Marni Penning, Rita Amparita, Mort Shelby, Lise Bruneau, Ryan Dalusung, Belsheber Rusape, Joey Sourlis, Nicole Perez, Holly Adams, Matthew Pauli, Stephanie Nemeth-Parker, Julie-Ann Elliott, James Konicek, Nanette Savard, Steve Wannall, Scott McCormick, Drew Kopas, Matthew Bassett, Ken Jackson, Nora Achrati, Bradley Foster Smith, Nicole Shara, Richard Rohan, Christopher Walker and Karen Novak.</p>"; 
